+Visual rules: 승인 규칙 없음. 현재 코드 측정값(measured, not approved): `src/style.css` form gap 12px·max-width 480px·좌우 padding 16px, input·textarea·button min-height 44px(textarea 120px), 1280px 이상에서 input만 min-height 40px.
+Proposed changes: none.
+Not applicable / pending: 글자 수 표시 규칙은 ROADMAP S1-R0에서 결정. 1280px input 40px가 의도인지 미확인(결함으로 기록하지 않음).
+Execution proof: 없음(아직 실행된 디자인 검사 없음).
+
+## Rule coverage
+
+One row per measurable rule; a ROADMAP design Check names these rows. A rule with no
+check is unmeasured, never passed. Result links the latest TASK entry; no copied log.
+Design-check results are reported in JOEDESIGN's result-line form
+(`check | result | sizes x states, mode | rendered or code | spot check`; a `changed` fix stays under 남은 문제).
+
+| Rule | Check | Spot check | Layouts | Sizes | States | Unmeasured | Result |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| (none yet) | — | not spot-checked | — | — | — | 모든 시각 규칙 미정; 글자 수 표시 행은 S1-R0 결정 후 추가 | not run |
